    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 16 minutes, with her consent. She has named a health care agent, and a written health care directive form was given for her to complete at home. She wants complete and frank information about her health and to make her own decisions. No specific treatment preferences were recorded today; the discussion will continue at next year&apos;s visit or sooner if her health changes. [S]</paragraph></text>

